ind":"update","title":"Demo Update!","summary":"Some updates for the demo based on some of the player feedback I have recieved: [*] If you are able to get your party strong enough to reach the overflow limit it will instead be displayed as INF and no longer crash the game or only do 1 damage. This will also change the damage counter at the to to display NaN due to how numbers interact with infinity preventing future level ups [/*][*] The turn counter damage multiplier has added additional damage multipliers every 10 turns to prevent indefinit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043759","verified_at":"2026-10-26T11:25:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4140210-1846651706690793","game_id":"steam-4140210","kind":"announcement","title":"Looking for Feedback!","summary":"Looking for player feedback!The game has been updated to include a feedback form, accessible by pressing F7 or clicking the F7 button located in the top right of the screen. This form will send the current state of the game along with a screenshot (toggleable) and some basic information about the system you are playing on and will post it to our Discord bug reports channel. You can find the invite to the Discord in the Links button on the title screen. Looking forward to hearing player feedback ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:30:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690793","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4140210-1846651706686009","game_id":"steam-4140210","kind":"announcement","title":"New Demo Build Updates Steam Deck Support","summary":"What was added:Improved Gamepad navigation